      "seed": 51,
      "prompt": "Remove the character's near-side arm, the glove hand and the whole near-side jacket sleeve with its cuff completely, and paint what was behind them: the dark purple jacket's own side and back panel covering the torso down to the hem, with the hood behind the neck and the open front of the jacket with its violet neon lines, in exactly the same flat cel-shaded anime art style and colors. The jacket stays on the body like a sleeveless vest. Keep the headset, the purple hair, the face, the black bodysuit, the black leggings, the sneakers, the pose, the proportions and the position exactly unchanged."
    },
    {
      "name": "C",
      "from": null,
      "seed": 61,
      "prompt": "Remove the character's whole dark purple hooded jacket completely, including the hood, both sleeves and the cuffs, and paint what was behind it: the black long-sleeve turtleneck bodysuit on the torso and the arms, the shoulders, the back and the hip, with the black leggings and the black fingerless gloves, in exactly the same flat cel-shaded anime art style, black outlines and colors. The arm hangs straight down at her side as before. Keep the headset, the purple hair, the face, the leggings, the sneakers, the pose, the proportions and the position exactly unchanged."
    },
    {
      "name": "E",
      "from": "C",
      "seed": 62,
      "prompt": "Remove the character's near-side arm and hand completely, and paint what was behind them: the side and the back of the torso and the hip of the black bodysuit, in exactly the same flat cel-shaded anime art style, black outlines and colors. The other arm is hidden behind the body and not visible. Keep the headset, the purple hair, the face, the torso, the leggings, the sneakers, the pose, the proportions and the position exactly unchanged."
    },
    {
      "name": "D",
      "from": "E",
      "seed": 73,
      "prompt": "Make the character's clothes torn after a fight, keeping the pose, proportions, art style, outlines and colors exactly the same: the black turtleneck bodysuit has several ragged rips with frayed edges on the shoulder, the upper back, the side of the ribs and the waist, showing small patches of skin with light scratches, but the chest, the belly, the hip and the buttocks stay fully covered by black fabric that is only frayed and slashed at the edges; the black leggings have holes, ladder runs and dangling torn strips on the thighs and the calves showing small patches of skin, but most of the legging fabric remains on both thighs and both calves. She is never naked. Keep the headset, the hair, the face, the sneakers and the silhouette exactly unchanged."
    }
